.0,"y":63.73,"tx":"In this illustrative scene, an idea is shared with its limitations, questions and traces of early versions. The conversation is not about handing out marks. It reveals what others understand immediately, what is missing and what makes them want to try it.","fn":["Jost","Regular"],"fs":16.0,"lh":28.8,"col":{"v":"Rôles/muted"},"al":"LEFT","w":712.05,"ar":"H","nl":3,"wmin":699.06,"wmax":722.0,"sv":{"fr":"Dans cette scène illustrative, on présente une idée avec ses limites, ses questions et les traces de ses premières versions. L’échange ne cherche pas à distribuer des bons points. Il permet de découvrir ce que les autres comprennent spontanément, ce qui manque et ce qui leur donne envie d’essayer.","en":"In this illustrative scene, an idea is shared with its limitations, questions and traces of early versions. The conversation is not about handing out marks. It reveals what others understand immediately, what is missing and what makes them want to try it.","ar":"في هذا المشهد التوضيحي، تُعرض فكرة مع حدودها وأسئلتها وآثار نسخها الأولى. لا يهدف النقاش إلى توزيع الدرجات، بل إلى اكتشاف ما يفهمه الآخرون تلقائيًا، وما ينقصهم، وما يدفعهم إلى التجربة.","n":"Commun/Dans cette scène illustrative, on présen…"}}]},{"t":"F","n":".cp-project-block","x":0.0,"y":977.7,"w":745,"h":175.39,"s":{"v":"Contenus/line"},"sw":[1.0,0,0,0],"ch":[{"t":"T","x":0.0,"y":24.35,"tx":"Keep a question for tomorrow","fn":["Jost","Medium"],"fs":20.0,"lh":28.0,"col":{"v":"Rôles/logo"},"al":"LEFT","ls":-0.3,"sv":{"fr":"Garder une question pour demain","en":"Keep a question for tomorrow","ar":"سؤال نحتفظ به للغد","n":"Commun/Garder une question pour demain"}},{"t":"T","x":0.0,"y":64.34,"tx":"The notebook can then describe a concrete decision: simplify an action, rethink an explanation or let go of an idea that did not work. Showing those choices makes the work more approachable and reminds us that projects grow through adjustments and other perspectives.","fn":["Jost","Regular"],"fs":16.0,